  "foodServing010": "Bebe 2-3 tazas al día; prepara a 80°C (sin hervir) para preservar la L-teanina",
  "@foodServing010": {},
  "foodNutrients010": "L-theanine, EGCG (catechins), Caffeine (low), Antioxidants",
